# LEDGER — MSME Credit Risk & IFRS 9 PD Modeling Engine

**LEDGER** is a quantitative credit risk modeling engine built from scratch in Python (`pandas`, `numpy`, `sqlite3`) for Indian MSME loan portfolios. It implements bank-grade data validation, borrower-level partitioning, structural multicollinearity screening, and leakage-free Weight of Evidence (WoE) / Information Value (IV) feature engineering aligned with **RBI IRAC** norms and **IFRS 9 / Basel IRB** scorecard standards.

---

